      "content": "i appreciate that, really. but it feels so undignified. just waiting for some random medical event to take me out, or for my body to just fail one day. it feels like i have no say in anything anymore. like i'm just a passenger in a car that's driving itself toward a cliff. i wish i could just decide when the trip is over instead of just being dragged along.",
